  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Total solution <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p></blockquote>",
